      "academic_org": "Artic BSc PhD Pgm in Math Sci",
      "learning_outcomes": "Upon completion of the course, students are able to:---\n\nDemonstrate understanding in basic the definitions of algebraic structures, and in algebraic properties and their consequences for various algebraic structures;\n\nDemonstrate ability in recognizing underlying algebraic structures which are common to various concrete mathematical examples;\n\nDemonstrate understanding in the basics of group theory, ring theory, and field theory;\n\nDemonstrate ability in applying basic results and techniques to solve problems in the theory and other related subjects.",
